              </content>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-4">
              <num>4</num>
              <heading>Paragraph 49(x)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Omit “$801,410,000”, substitute “$812,207,000”.</p>
              </content>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-5">
              <num>5</num>
              <heading>At the end of section 49</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Add:</p>
              </content>
              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-5__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <content>
                  <p>; (y)	for the financial year starting on <date date="2024-07-01">1 July 2024</date>—$811,169,000.</p>
                  <p>[<i>Minister’s second reading speech made in—</i></p>
                  <p><i>House of Representatives on 2 December 2021</i></p>
                  <p><i>Senate on 30 March 2022</i>]</p>
                  <p>(170/21)</p>
                </content>
              </quotedStructure>
            </hcontainer>
          </hcontainer>
